<title>USA: United Dominion completes Varco-Pruden sale.</title>
<headline>United Dominion completes Varco-Pruden sale.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Industries Ltd said Wednesday that it has completed the previously announced sale of its Varco-Pruden Buildings Division to LTV Corp for $187.5 million in cash.</p>
<p>Varco-Pruden has eight U.S. plants and three international joint ventures and reported sales of $305 million in 1996.</p>
